cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Ilmarinen: a physics-principled neural-architecture meta-optimizer"
abstract: >-
  Ilmarinen selects a neural architecture — its computational contract (arena),
  its primitive operations, and its width and depth — for a dataset by minimizing
  a single description-length objective, with every complexity charge derived as a
  code length rather than a hand-set constant.
type: software
